# Engine Rat: Deathtouch (CR 702.2). Bot1's 1/1 Rat attacks on turn 3; Bot2's Wall of Wood (0/3) blocks, and the Rat's one
# damage - deathtouch - is lethal to the Wall (CR 702.2b, 704.5h). The Wall deals no damage, so the Rat survives and Bot2
# loses nothing. Without deathtouch the Wall would have taken one damage and lived.

